---
import Section from "../shared/Section.astro";
import { profile } from "../../utils/profile";
import { withBase } from "../../utils/url";
---

<Section id="about" eyebrow="About" title="Short version">
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] md:gap-14">
    <!-- Portrait card: taller crop, slightly desaturated so the casual source
         photo sits with the palette instead of against it. -->
    <figure class="w-full max-w-[340px] self-start overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface-1 md:max-w-none" data-reveal>
      <img
        src={withBase("images/ashishp1.jpeg")}
        alt="Ashish Kumar Jha"
        width="280"
        height="350"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover [object-position:50%_20%] grayscale-[30%]"
      />
      <figcaption class="border-t border-line px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[12px] tracking-wide text-ink-3">
        {profile.name} · {profile.location}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-ink-2" data-reveal data-reveal-index="1">
      <p>
        I'm a backend engineer based in {profile.location}. I joined Novoinvent Software
        as an intern in March 2023 and have been an engineer there since June 2024.
      </p>
      <p>
        The day job is Java and Spring Boot services on MySQL. I own features from the
        schema to the endpoint, and the parts I go deepest on are multi-tenancy,
        concurrency control, caching and the data layer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work I build side projects to understand how things actually behave. The
        task scheduler exists so I could see what happens at the thread level. The
        ticketing system exists to understand contention, and I wrote
        <span class="hl">a 200-thread test against real PostgreSQL</span> to prove it
        does not oversell.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I'm building an LLM agent harness. When a service needs a UI, I reach
        for Next.js.
      </p>

      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-4 border-t border-line pt-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Focus</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">Backend · Java</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Currently</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">Novoinvent Software</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="mono-label">Learning</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-ink">LLM agent tooling</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
